ae2s_ponder.gui.inscriber.step.0=Put the Silicon Press in the upper press slot. Leave the lower slot empty for this printing recipe; the press is reusable.
ae2s_ponder.gui.inscriber.step.1=Insert silicon into the middle input. Check the installed recipe viewer if your pack changes the material.
ae2s_ponder.gui.inscriber.step.2=Supply power and wait for real machine progress. The live guide observes synchronized progress or a completed output, including fast upgraded machines.
ae2s_ponder.gui.inscriber.step.3=The Printed Silicon appears in the output. Combine it with a printed circuit and redstone in a separate assembly operation.
ae2s_ponder.gui.inscriber.step.4=Collect the result while leaving the press installed. For automation, verify each accessible machine face with one test item.
